          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, Col. II, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>From me in gold 22 dinar, 2 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d</li>\n<li>Promissory note 1&frac12; dinar</li>\n<li>From my cousin 1 dinar</li>\n<li>102&frac12;, &frac14; din. less 1 habba ______________________________________________</li>\n<li>Debit beginning: his note on 7 dinar</li>\n<li>109\u2154 dinar ______________________________________________</li>\n<li>Balance of debit 14 dinar 1 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d ______________________________________________</li>\n<li>Balance, debit 14 dinar \u2159</li>\n<li>His note 100 dinar</li>\n<li>His note 66 dinar 9 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d</li>\n<li>His note 36 dinar</li>\n<li>His note 30 dinar less \u2159</li>\n<li>His note 26 dinar</li></ol>\n",
